WEBVTT

01:44.940 --> 01:46.450
It's all right, Ichiko.

01:46.670 --> 01:49.480
I'm sure we can definitely fly!

02:08.090 --> 02:09.260
What in the...?

02:13.440 --> 02:15.100
You're from back then...

02:18.080 --> 02:20.270
Thank you for coming.

02:29.010 --> 02:29.950
Yumemi...

02:35.530 --> 02:37.750
I'm scared!

02:38.010 --> 02:40.120
I'm scared too!

02:44.010 --> 02:46.880
Hey, did you really think you could fly?

02:47.290 --> 02:50.720
Yeah, I'll definitely do better next time.

02:53.630 --> 02:56.460
Yeah, I'd better do better next time too.

03:11.110 --> 03:11.760
Munto.

03:24.950 --> 03:27.980
As I thought, he can't handle it by himself.

03:33.140 --> 03:33.970
What?!

03:38.310 --> 03:42.480
The source of Akuto - there are now <i>more girls from the other dimension...</i>

03:44.930 --> 03:47.730
Is this Munto's doing?

03:48.420 --> 03:51.050
But if I have that power...

03:51.050 --> 03:53.910
If I could get my hands on those girls...

03:54.780 --> 03:57.330
...the Heavens will be saved!

04:14.050 --> 04:14.800
Munto!

04:17.840 --> 04:18.740
You're here.

04:19.980 --> 04:20.890
Are you all right?

04:21.380 --> 04:24.280
Yeah, but try to hurry up.

04:24.280 --> 04:25.650
I can't hold it any longer.

04:42.600 --> 04:43.370
No!

05:02.930 --> 05:04.590
Let go of me!

05:04.590 --> 05:06.230
Ichiko! Suzume!

05:06.750 --> 05:08.210
What are you doing?

05:08.210 --> 05:09.360
Let go of us!

05:09.540 --> 05:13.350
Let go! Mister, let go!

05:11.810 --> 05:14.940
Who would've guessed they had powers like this.

05:14.940 --> 05:19.620
All right, as long as I have them, the Akuto of the Heavens will be replenished.

05:19.930 --> 05:22.870
The world can be sustained!

05:23.130 --> 05:25.070
Stop it, Gntarl!

05:27.080 --> 05:32.840
King Munto, although I don't know what tricks you've played,

05:33.260 --> 05:38.270
I applaud you for summoning these three sources.

05:38.270 --> 05:42.600
However, your method won't be able to save the Heavens.

05:42.600 --> 05:49.480
Your method won't be able to restore the flow of Akuto, you fool!

05:51.320 --> 05:54.540
I am the only one who can protect the Heavens.

05:54.540 --> 06:00.310
I will use the powers of these girls and stop the Heavens from falling.

06:00.310 --> 06:03.280
I will save the Heavens!

06:03.280 --> 06:07.160
You over there, come over to me.

06:07.470 --> 06:10.540
Help me save the Heavens!

06:14.460 --> 06:20.090
Munto, as the king of the Heavens, you're rather ridiculous.

06:21.890 --> 06:23.180
Munto...

06:26.510 --> 06:28.350
What are you doing?

06:28.350 --> 06:32.150
Your world will meet its destruction if you waste too much time.

06:32.150 --> 06:33.710
Now, come here.

06:33.710 --> 06:34.530
Yumemi!

06:37.460 --> 06:39.300
You're going to open up the future, aren't you?

06:39.300 --> 06:40.610
If so, get going!

06:40.960 --> 06:43.530
We'll be fine!

06:43.690 --> 06:45.710
Shut up, you brats.

06:45.710 --> 06:47.500
Shut your mouths up.

07:01.710 --> 07:05.410
If this pillar of light goes,

07:05.410 --> 07:09.390
the space-time portal will close and the balance of both worlds will break.

07:10.090 --> 07:12.540
The Heavens will then fall immediately,

07:13.840 --> 07:15.690
and our futures will be lost.

07:31.410 --> 07:32.420
Munto.

07:36.260 --> 07:41.550
Munto, I'm sorry, I can't leave without them.

07:46.690 --> 07:47.560
Yumemi...

07:51.190 --> 07:54.060
Are you going to give up on the future?

07:55.010 --> 08:00.110
I finally understand what I should do.

08:01.640 --> 08:04.870
I understand what opening up the future means.

08:05.130 --> 08:06.310
Wait!

08:06.310 --> 08:09.250
If this pillar breaks, our futures will-

08:09.250 --> 08:10.620
Nothing will be lost.

08:13.430 --> 08:16.070
The world will not lose anything.

08:16.630 --> 08:19.490
No one will lose anything.

08:19.490 --> 08:21.880
The future will never be lost.

08:22.510 --> 08:24.130
Believe in me, Munto.

08:29.580 --> 08:31.140
That's right, come here.

08:31.880 --> 08:34.390
You're a very good girl.

08:35.160 --> 08:39.780
By sacrificing you, the Heavens will be saved.

08:40.650 --> 08:44.650
Now, in order to stabilize your powers,

08:44.850 --> 08:46.820
I'll crystallize you three!

08:46.820 --> 08:49.620
Let's begin with you, young lady.

08:55.570 --> 08:56.370
Yumemi!

09:04.120 --> 09:05.590
What?!

09:05.590 --> 09:07.860
The crystallization stopped?!

09:11.400 --> 09:16.830
Even if you trap a person in stone and deceive their heart,

09:18.350 --> 09:19.900
The future won't open.

09:20.510 --> 09:24.530
You won't be able to save the future by sacrificing the feelings of others!

09:25.900 --> 09:26.800
That's why...

09:28.060 --> 09:30.990
That's why I will protect my own spirit...

09:31.910 --> 09:33.720
I will protect my friends!

09:34.680 --> 09:40.790
The future which Ichiko, Suzume, and everyone else wish for...

09:41.070 --> 09:43.830
No matter what happens, I will protect it!

09:50.090 --> 09:54.030
I can see the destruction that's closing in on the world.

09:54.970 --> 10:00.900
The world had its flow of spirits stopped and, while engulfed in darkness, forgot what it looked like -

10:00.900 --> 10:02.910
just like it's about to lose its own shape.

10:04.030 --> 10:06.660
But it still hasn't ended yet.

10:07.420 --> 10:09.490
The destruction hasn't been written in stone yet.

10:10.290 --> 10:13.160
The future isn't lost.

10:15.960 --> 10:21.170
You fool, if you refuse the crystallization...

10:24.380 --> 10:29.180
...I'll crystallize these two to save the Heavens instead. Are you fine with that?!

10:32.120 --> 10:34.810
What's with that look?

10:34.810 --> 10:37.930
Do you not care about what will happen to these two?

10:38.630 --> 10:43.400
Are you going to abandon the spirits of these two?!

10:56.150 --> 11:01.460
No matter how much the world changes, there should never be any spirits that are abandoned.

11:12.270 --> 11:14.220
Suzume, are you all right?

11:14.220 --> 11:14.850
Yeah.

11:17.760 --> 11:18.710
Ichiko?

11:18.710 --> 11:19.630
I'm fine.

11:22.090 --> 11:26.360
Actually, anyone can protect the world.

11:27.260 --> 11:29.820
You can protect the world without having to sacrifice anything.

11:31.280 --> 11:36.610
You just have to protect your own spirit and the people who are most important to you.

11:38.160 --> 11:40.560
Don't give up and abandon them.

11:55.560 --> 11:57.710
It'll be all right, you two.

11:58.310 --> 11:59.560
It'll be all right.

13:01.470 --> 13:04.290
Munto... I'm sorry...

13:05.660 --> 13:07.600
No, I was just surprised.

13:10.410 --> 13:12.550
Are these the people you want to protect?

13:14.420 --> 13:15.240
I see.

13:16.560 --> 13:20.260
I am Munto... no, I'm Lord Munto,

13:20.260 --> 13:21.430
so call me Lord Munto.

13:21.700 --> 13:22.710
Huh?

13:22.710 --> 13:25.190
He's weird! He calls himself "Lord"!

13:33.950 --> 13:35.490
The world is beginning to fall.

13:37.340 --> 13:38.740
What should we do now?

13:39.750 --> 13:45.410
It'll be all right, the things you've always protected are still there.

13:48.520 --> 13:50.420
But the pillar is...

13:51.090 --> 13:53.170
It's still there.

13:54.980 --> 14:01.550
Before I came here, I learned that everything in this world is built out of spirits.

14:01.550 --> 14:03.780
Everything originates from the spirit.

14:05.070 --> 14:09.690
In that case, that pillar of light should also be created from spirits, shouldn't it?

14:12.270 --> 14:15.440
My heart is safely with me.

14:18.100 --> 14:19.040
Right here.

14:19.840 --> 14:20.910
Yumemi...

14:20.910 --> 14:25.660
Don't worry, I won't shut out my heart anymore.

14:28.920 --> 14:31.090
It seems like I'm being lectured by you again.

14:31.950 --> 14:33.630
I finally understand now.

14:33.900 --> 14:35.460
It's just as you said.

14:37.470 --> 14:41.720
The one I should protect is already here.

14:51.510 --> 14:54.560
Now, those clothes aren't suited for fighting.

14:54.560 --> 14:55.470
Put these on.

15:06.600 --> 15:09.440
These clothes suit you.

15:09.440 --> 15:11.750
Is this his fetish?!

15:25.820 --> 15:29.680
Munto, let us open up the future.

15:55.760 --> 15:57.630
The spirit is something you cannot see.

15:59.980 --> 16:05.220
Because people wanted to know what it looked like, they gave it a form.

16:11.300 --> 16:12.880
That form is a human.

16:14.020 --> 16:15.740
That form is the world.

16:16.480 --> 16:20.250
I see the very form of the spirit.

16:21.760 --> 16:23.110
Although I'm scared...

16:23.510 --> 16:25.100
Although I want to run away...

16:26.060 --> 16:28.220
I stand in front of the mirror.

16:30.140 --> 16:32.950
The reflection in the mirror is my heart.

16:34.230 --> 16:37.780
What's standing there is the real me.

16:39.380 --> 16:43.070
I'm wearing awkward clothes and my hair looks funny...

16:43.750 --> 16:45.380
I don't look cute at all.

16:46.520 --> 16:48.510
In fact, I'm about to cry.

16:50.770 --> 16:55.600
Yet, I still stand there and look at the reflection.

16:58.460 --> 17:03.030
Of course, I'm angry and sad, too.

17:04.920 --> 17:12.290
But before I knew it, I felt at peace with those honest feelings.

17:14.410 --> 17:19.030
Then I discovered I could accept the way I was.

17:22.160 --> 17:23.790
When it's all over,

17:24.640 --> 17:30.400
I'll be able to take the next step with courage.

17:32.680 --> 17:35.520
I will change myself with this single step.

17:36.770 --> 17:43.320
That small reflection of courage will one day reach the spirit too.

17:45.120 --> 17:47.470
The shape of the heart will continue to change.

17:48.230 --> 17:50.520
The shape of the world will also continue to change.

17:52.240 --> 17:55.730
The world will become more beautiful.

17:57.690 --> 18:02.520
While reflecting this beautiful world, the spirit will become stronger.

18:04.440 --> 18:06.850
I will become stronger.

18:08.550 --> 18:12.630
I will join with everyone, and together with everyone...

18:25.840 --> 18:28.450
Yumemi, you're going to be late.

18:28.450 --> 18:31.320
You'll be in your third year starting today, so do your best.

18:31.320 --> 18:32.640
Okay.

18:33.490 --> 18:36.930
All right, Montaro, next is Ultra Jump!

18:35.890 --> 18:38.530
Yumemi, did you grow taller?

18:40.090 --> 18:41.080
I did?

18:41.320 --> 18:43.540
Sis, you grew!

18:43.540 --> 18:44.330
Really?

18:44.330 --> 18:45.350
Your butt.

18:45.350 --> 18:46.090
Hey!

18:46.810 --> 18:52.710
Mom, I'll be going to other people's houses, so I'll be home late.

18:52.710 --> 18:54.480
With Ichiko-chan and the others?

18:54.480 --> 18:55.460
Yeah.

18:55.460 --> 18:56.520
Be careful.

18:56.850 --> 18:57.950
Okay!

19:09.130 --> 19:11.530
Ichiko, what should we eat tonight?

19:11.810 --> 19:13.310
Anything is fine.

19:13.310 --> 19:16.070
Just make something you like.

19:16.070 --> 19:20.440
You made it to your third year even though you're just as stupid as I am.

19:20.440 --> 19:21.960
So if we don't celebrate-

19:21.960 --> 19:24.570
I'm not! I'm not as stupid as you!

19:24.570 --> 19:26.700
What are you talking about?
We're like exactly the same.

19:26.700 --> 19:29.980
Sho-chan and Mi-chan too, everyone is like their-

19:29.980 --> 19:32.090
Shut up! They're not!

19:32.090 --> 19:33.860
Go check a mirror!

19:33.860 --> 19:35.050
Look at this photo.

19:35.050 --> 19:36.520
Stop it!

19:37.250 --> 19:39.660
Have a safe trip, Kazuya!

19:39.660 --> 19:41.460
Study hard, okay?

19:41.460 --> 19:42.370
Okay.

19:42.370 --> 19:43.320
Don't trip.

19:45.900 --> 19:47.460
Hey, are you all right?

19:47.460 --> 19:48.530
I have a nosebleed...

19:59.140 --> 20:01.290
Ichiko, good morning.

20:01.290 --> 20:02.460
Yeah, morning.

20:03.930 --> 20:05.400
Oh, Yumemi!

20:05.400 --> 20:06.410
Morning!

20:06.410 --> 20:07.620
Good morning!

20:08.800 --> 20:10.640
Hey, wait!

20:10.640 --> 20:12.390
Wait!

20:12.390 --> 20:15.020
Takashi, move!

20:16.680 --> 20:17.720
Move!

20:23.280 --> 20:26.280
Wait for me!

22:20.990 --> 22:23.190
This has become quite worrisome.

22:23.840 --> 22:29.580
That distortion of time-space should've disappeared with the Outsider.

22:30.190 --> 22:32.320
Then why is it still there?

22:32.320 --> 22:35.270
Don't tell me he's on the other side of the distortion...

22:35.270 --> 22:37.520
It might not be Gass.

22:37.520 --> 22:40.360
Gridori took the full brunt of the Outsider's power.

22:40.650 --> 22:44.270
He's sure a tough one; I'll go report it now.

22:44.270 --> 22:45.490
Just wait.

22:45.490 --> 22:48.710
The distortion is still small, so there's no need to hurry.

22:49.430 --> 22:52.010
Besides, the palace is...

22:52.660 --> 22:54.710
Yeah, they don't have time to worry about it.

22:57.730 --> 23:02.460
Louie, the representatives of the Lower World will be here soon.

23:02.460 --> 23:04.640
Shall I bring them directly to the conference hall?

23:06.530 --> 23:10.730
Even though it's not official, this will be the first time the representatives of both sides meet.

23:11.300 --> 23:15.260
We can't show them the state that the Heavens is in right now.

23:15.260 --> 23:17.280
Then I guess they'll just have to wait.

23:17.850 --> 23:19.070
Munto, you...

23:20.910 --> 23:22.240
I've been trying to come up with something.

23:24.280 --> 23:27.450
It's just a gut feeling, but I don't think we'll be able to find him.

23:29.190 --> 23:32.910
If it comes to that, then we'll send Lady Ryuely out as our representative.

23:34.140 --> 23:35.640
This isn't a joking matter!

23:35.640 --> 23:36.890
Let's go and search too!

23:37.530 --> 23:40.260
Seriously, what is he thinking?

23:41.480 --> 23:43.720
Lady Ryuely, Lord Munto is...

23:44.170 --> 23:46.970
Lord Munto is gone.

23:46.970 --> 23:48.230
I know.

23:49.260 --> 23:51.570
Can you feel it, Toche?

23:52.560 --> 23:56.750
The flow of Akuto between the two worlds is reverting back to normal.

23:56.750 --> 24:00.720
The imprisoned spirits are beginning to flow between the worlds again.

24:01.810 --> 24:08.030
However, in order for the solidified spirits to be joined anew and restored to their original forms,

24:08.030 --> 24:11.300
much time and understanding are still needed.

24:11.300 --> 24:15.370
That will be a journey longer and harder than anything we've ever faced.

24:15.370 --> 24:19.000
It is a challenge that Munto must face from this point onward.

24:22.970 --> 24:24.410
But before that,

24:25.940 --> 24:28.900
Munto must complete an important preparation.

24:29.880 --> 24:31.050
Lord Munto?

24:32.330 --> 24:38.220
We shall just wait until Munto returns.
